# Never commit secrets or machine-local state
.ssh/
*.key
*_rsa
*_ed25519
.config/gh/
.npmrc
*.age

# chezmoi's own machine-local answers
home/.chezmoi.toml

# Backup output. These scripts write outside the repo by default; this is the
# guard for the day someone passes -o . by mistake. The repo is public.
*.dump
mcp-servers.json
agents-skills.tar.gz
databases.tsv

# Agent instructions, machine-local on purpose. CLAUDE.md carries how Claude
# Code should work in this repo (commit at the end of a session, no
# Co-Authored-By trailer, and the "never trust a config file - read the live
# value back" rule the doctor checks exist to enforce). It is deliberately NOT
# tracked: the repo is public, and this is a personal working preference rather
# than something a reader of the dotfiles needs or should inherit.
CLAUDE.md
